 operating range  and you can support design decisions  where  you can for example compare different  stereo heights  because the simulation time was reduced  from months to hours  so this is a useful time for  engineering processes the last thing is  that you can do faster  troubleshooting and have a deeper  process understanding  due to the use of stimulation  so i want to thank you this is the  team at the tue grass which is  developing the software  my name is kristen bits please  contact me if you have any  any further interest any questions or if  you are interested in a collaboration  or if you want to test out this  simulation software  thank you
 

